  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "31",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 31"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "31",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo aumfwile ukuti bamwana Labani balesosa abati, “Yakobo nabuula ifyuma fyonse shifwe akwete. Kabili ubukankala buntu akwete, abufumishe ku fintu fyakwa shifwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yakobo amona ukuti Labani talemulolesha bwino nga kale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe epakweba Yakobo ati, “Bwelelamo ku calo ca fikolwe fyobe na ba mu lupwa lobe, elyo na ine nakulaba na iwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Yakobo atumine amashiwi kuli Rakeli na Leya ukuti bese mu mpanga ukwali ifitekwa fyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo abeba ati, “Nimona ukuti bawiso tabandolesha bwino nga filya cali kale. Lelo Lesa wa batata aba na ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imwe namwishiba ukuti nalibombela bawiso na maka yandi yonse, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lelo bawiso balincenjesha pakwalula amalipilo yandi imiku ikumi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31:7",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Imiku ikumi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Calola mukuti imikufye iyingi nangu lyonsefye.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lelo Lesa tabaleka ukuti bancitile icakungonawila umutende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga cakuti basosa abati, ‘Ifitekwa ifya mabala efikaba amalipilo yobe, lyena ninshi ifitekwa fyonse fyalafyala utwana utwa mabala.’ Kabili nga cakuti basosa abati, ‘Ifitekwa fya mindoloshi efikaba amalipilo yobe,’ nalyo ninshi ifitekwa fyonse fyalafyala utwana utwa mindoloshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Lesa napokolola bawiso ifitekwa, nomba afipeele kuli ine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pa nshita inama shitamfyanya, limo nalilotele iciloto. Muli ici ciloto namwene ukuti basawe baletamfya bali aba mindoloshi, bamo aba fisemba, bambi nabo abamabala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili muli ici ciloto malaika wakwa Lesa anjeba ati, ‘Yakobo!’ Na ine nayasuka nati, ‘Epo ndi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika epakunjeba ati, ‘Inuna amenso, mona basawe bonse abaletamfya, bamo ba mindoloshi, bamo ba fisemba, elyo bambi ba mabala. Ncitile ifi pantu nalimona ifyo Labani akucitila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.28.18+GEN.28.19+GEN.28.20+GEN.28.21+GEN.28.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Icite 28:18-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nine Lesa uwakumonekele ku Betele,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Uwakumonekele ku Betele:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ba Baibele bamo batila, “Lesa wa ku Betele.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kulya waimike ilibwe waitilapo amafuta, elyo wandaya ne cilayo. Kanshi nomba fuma muli cino calo bwangu, ubwelele ku calo kumwenu.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Rakeli na Leya bamwaswike abati, “Bushe ifwe tucili natukwata ifyakupokako pa fyuma fya cishilano fya batata? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bushe ifwe tata tatumonafye nga benafyalo? Alitushitishafye kabili alilya ne mpango apokele pali ifwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cine cine ifyuma Lesa apoka batata, nomba fyuma fyesu na bana besu. Eico citafye ifyo Lesa akwebele.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yakobo aninika abakashi bakwe na bamwane pa ngamila, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atangisha pantanshi ifitekwa fyakwe fyonse, pamo pene ne fyuma fyonse anonkele mu Padani Aramu, epakulabwelelamo kuli wishi Isaki mu calo ca Kenani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Labani aile kukubeya impaanga, Rakeli ashele aiba utulubi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Rakeli aiba utulubi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Pantu uwali ne nsambu shakupoka ifyacishilano abafyashi nga bafwa ni uyo uwalesunga tulya tulubi twa pa ŋanda, ekutila imilungu yabo.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " utwali e milungu yakwa wishi iya pa ŋanda yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo nao acenjelela Labani umwina Aramu, afyuka ukwabula ukumwebako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi afyukile asenda ne fintu fyonse ifyo akwete, ayabuka no mumana wa Yufurate, alungama ku calo ca mpili isha mu Gileadi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa bushiku bwalenga shitatu baisa eba Labani ukuti Yakobo alifyuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani epakusenda ba lupwa lwakwe, bakonka Yakobo pa nshiku cine lubali, bamusanga mu calo ca mpili isha mu Gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo ubushiku, Lesa amonekela Labani umwina Aramu mu ciloto, amweba ati, “Ucenjele, wiesha kulanda kuli Yakobo nelyo cimo, icisuma nangu icibi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani asangile Yakobo ninshi acita inkambi mu calo ca mpili sha mu Gileadi. Elyo Labani na ba lupwa lwakwe nabo bacita inkambi uko kwine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani epakweba Yakobo ati, “Bushe cinshi ucitile ifi? Walincenjesha, kabili wasenda na bana bandi abanakashi kwati ni bankole ba mu nkondo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bushe cinshi wafyukile mu bumfisolo no kuncenjesha wancenjesha? Bushe cinshi ushanjebeleko? Ala nga nalikufishapo ne nsansa, tuleimba no kulisha insombo na maseese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tawalekele nokuti ntomone abeshikulu bandi na bana bandi abanakashi pakubafishapo. Tamwali mano muco wacitile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ine ninkwata amaka yakukucitapo cimo icibi, lelo Lesa wakwa wiso anjebele ubushiku ati, ‘Ucenjele, wiesha kulanda kuli Yakobo nelyo cimo, icisuma nelyo icibi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwena ico ufumineko nico walefuluka ukubwelela ku ŋanda yakwa wiso. Nomba cinshi waibile imilungu yandi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo ayasuka Labani ati, “Nali no mwenso, pantu naletontonkanya ukuti limbi kuti mwampoka abana benu abanakashi ku makafye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo nga cakuti mwasanga umo ali ne milungu yenu, wena wakwipayafye. Kanshi fwayeni mwe bene pa cinso ca ba lupwa lwesu nga palipo icintu cenu cimo ico nsendele. Elyo nga epo cili, mucibuule.” Yakobo taishibe ukuti ni Rakeli ewaibile imilungu yakwa Labani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Labani epakuya mwitenti lyakwa Yakobo, na mwitenti lyakwa Leya, na mwitenti lya basha banakashi babili, lelo monse tatusangilemo iyoo. Ilyo afuma mwitenti lyakwa Leya, elyo aingila mwiteni lyakwa Rakeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Rakeli ninshi nafumya tulubi ele tubika mu cakwikalapo pa ngamila kabili no kwikala ninshi epo ekele. Labani afwaya mu fipe fyonsefye, awe nokuti atusange nakalya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Rakeli aebele wishi ati, “Mukwai mwimfulilwa ico nafilwa ukwiminina pa cinso cenu, ala nico ndi kumpepo.” Labani wena abikapofye ukulafwaya, lelo nokuti asange imilungu yakwe nakalya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo afulwa, alaebaula Labani. Aipusha Labani ati, “Bushe mulandu nshi nacita? Bushe bubifi nshi nacita pakuti mulenunga nge nama? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba apo mwafwaya mu fipe fyandi fyonse, bushe cipe cenu nshi musangilemo? Cibikeni pa cinso ca ba lupwa lwenu na ba lupwa lwandi uleke bapingule pali ifwe babili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twikele nenu imyaka amakumi yabili (20). Impaanga shenu ishikota ne mbushi shenu ishikota tashaleponya mafumo, kabili nshalilepo sukusuku nangu sawe nelyo umo pa mikuni yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo ifiswango fyaleipayapo icitekwa cenu cimo, nshaleleta iyo nama ifwile kuli imwe, lelo nalepyanikishapofye icitekwa candi ne mwine. Kabili mwalenjeba no kufutilapo inama abantu baleiba akasuba nangu ubushiku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi akasuba nalepya ku cipuki, elyo ubushiku kututumafye ku mpepo ukwabula ukumona utulo. Ifi efyali ubumi bwandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa myaka yonse iyi amakumi yabili (20) twaikele na imwe, efyo ubumi bwandi bwali. Namubombele imyaka ikumi limo na ine (14) pa bana benu abanakashi babili. Kabili namucemene ifitekwa fyenu pa myaka mutanda (6), lelo mwabikilepofye ukwalula amalipilo yandi imiku ikumi limo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukwabula ukuti Lesa wakwa tata, Lesa wakwa Abrahamu, Lesa uo tata Isaki atiina, abe na ine, awe ukwabula no kutwishika, nga mwantamfyafye nja iminwe nkutwa. Lelo Lesa alimona ifyo nacula nefyo nabombesha na maboko yandi, eico lelo ubushiku acimukalipilila.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani ayasuka Yakobo ati, “Aba banakashi bana bandi, abana nabo bana bandi, elyo ne fitekwa fine nafyo fitekwa fyandi. Fyonse ifi ulemona fyandi. Nomba kwena finshi lelo ningacitila abana bandi nangu aba bana bafyala? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ale nomba, iwe na ine natucite icipangano pakuti cibe e cakushinina pakati kesu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Yakobo abuula ilibwe aliminika pakuti libe icakwibukishishako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili aeba ba lupwa lwakwe ati, “Longanyeni amabwe,” nabo babuula amabwe bayatulika umwina. Elyo balya icakulya mupepi no mwina wa mabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani awinika ishina lya Yega Saduta,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31:47",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yega Saduta:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lishina lya mu Ciaramu calola mukuti umwina wakutwibukishako.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yakobo wena awinika ishina lya Galedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31:47",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Galedi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lishina lya mu Cihibulu. Calola mukuti, “umwina wakutwibukishako.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Labani asosa ati, “Uyu mwina wa mabwe ewaba lelo icakutushinina iwe na ine.” Kanshi eico uyu mwina waleitilwa Galedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili apa pene paleitwa Misipa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31:49",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Misipa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lishina lya mu Cihibulu lyalola mukuti, “ukubebeta.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " pantu Labani asosele ati, “Yawe engalatubebeta, iwe na ine ilyo tukaleka ukwikala pamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo kabili nga walacusha abana banakashi bandi nangu waupilapo abanakashi na bambi, nangu tapali umbi na ifwe, uli nokwibukisha ukuti kambone wesu pali iwe na ine ni Lesa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
