          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Labani alundapo ukweba Yakobo nokuti, “Mona umwina wa mabwe, mona ne libwe ili, ifi njiminike pakati ka iwe na ine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyu mwina wa mabwe e kambone ne libwe ili e kambone ukuti ine nshakacile uyu mwina ukwisa uko uli kukukucusha, elyo na iwe tawakacile uyu mwina neli libwe ukwisa uko ndi kukuncusha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lesa wakwa Abrahamu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31:53",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abrahamu … Naho:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yakobo mwishikulu wakwa Abrahamu, elyo Labani wena ali mwishikulu wakwa Naho.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na Lesa wakwa Naho, Lesa wa fikolwe fyabo akatupingule ifwe bonse babili.” Yakobo nao epakulapa mwishina lyakwa Lesa uo wishi Isaki atiina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo atuula ne lambo kulya kwine ku calo ca mpili, kabili aitako na ba lupwa lwakwe ku mitebeto. Panuma yakulya, basendama uko kwine ubo bushiku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 31:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lucelocelo cilya bwaca, Labani atomona abeshikulu bakwe na bamwane pakubashalikapo, kabili abapaala elyo aima, abwelelamo na kumwakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.31.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.31.55"
            ]
          }
        }
